  button: BIRTHDAY
  riddle: A plate, two presents, three candles, a party hat and a balloon. Somebody
    is a year older.
  hint: Tip the pile back a little. The presents are the layers, the plate sits underneath
    and the balloon floats on the right.
  complete: 'HAPPY BIRTHDAY

    Make a wish.'
